  "description": "Customers and Contacts (CRM) domain module for Project Atlas. Implemented in Sprint 2 \u2014 CRM & Customers. See docs/13-roadmap/sprint-2.md, docs/03-domain/customers.md, docs/03-domain/contacts.md.",
